   "value": "**Result of the cell above:** definitions only (prints the time for one t₃). Not yet run in Wolfram. The python equivalent (`core.py`: kron-built monodromy, quantum-minor t_a, float64 and exact mod-p modes) builds t₃ in ~0.1 s (float) / ~1 s (mod p).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
