   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result of the cell above (python port; exact rationals by CRT over 20 primes, all 36 reconstructed and verified on an extra prime; shown to 6 digits).** b⁰ piece: only (0,0,0,0) with coefficient 1.\n\n| label (a₁,k₂,a₃,k₄) | coefficient of b¹ | coefficient of b² |\n|---|---|---|\n| (0,0,0,0) | 3.42606 | 2.37421 |\n| (0,0,0,1) | −0.537451 | −1.32296 |\n| (0,0,0,2) | −0.695218 | −1.71131 |\n| (0,1,0,0) | 66.4776 | 71.3095 |\n| (0,1,0,1) | −33.5513 | −81.207 |\n| (0,1,0,2) | 9.80364 | −16.6068 |\n| (0,2,0,0) | 156.215 | 419.283 |\n| (0,2,0,1) | 55.8447 | −738.893 |\n| (0,2,0,2) | 0 | −45.7765 |\n| (0,3,0,0) | 353.872 | 341.317 |\n| (0,3,0,1) | 0 | −325.796 |\n| (0,3,0,2) | 0 | −721.919 |\n| (1,0,0,0) | −8.00832 | −19.7128 |\n| (1,0,0,1) | 7.83935 | 19.2969 |\n| (1,1,0,0) | 134.596 | −162.595 |\n| (1,1,0,1) | −33.2829 | 586.267 |\n| (1,1,0,2) | 0 | −96.3987 |\n| (1,2,0,0) | −1457.18 | 3315.43 |\n| (1,2,0,1) | 0 | −6630.07 |\n| (1,2,0,2) | 0 | 2775.38 |\n| (1,3,0,0) | 0 | 4165.18 |\n| (1,3,0,1) | 0 | −6984.46 |\n| (2,0,0,0) | −128.748 | −316.919 |\n| (2,1,0,0) | 1134.55 | −5147.75 |\n| (2,1,0,1) | 0 | 10086.2 |\n| (2,1,0,2) | 0 | −3626.76 |\n| (2,2,0,0) | 0 | −8387.68 |\n| (2,2,0,1) | 0 | 9884.59 |\n| (2,3,0,0) | 0 | −3691.32 |\n| (3,0,0,0) | 371.195 | 913.71 |\n| (3,1,0,0) | 0 | 304.776 |\n| (3,1,0,1) | 0 | 1397.48 |\n| (3,1,0,2) | 0 | 1402.15 |\n| (3,2,0,0) | 0 | 21637 |\n| (3,2,0,1) | 0 | 3407.01 |\n| (3,3,0,0) | 0 | 31535.1 |\n\nThe coefficients are homogeneous in the SoV charge (b-piece k of label x carries z-dependence of fixed degree); the pair-1 vectors are pure twist data: b¹: λ₁v_{z₄}⊗e₄ − e₁⊗ℓ₁, b²: −λ₁ v_{z₄}⊗ℓ₁ (= (e₄⊗e₁)_diag up to normalisation).",
